sequenceDiagram
actor U as 用户
participant V as MainWindow (View)
participant C as LoginController
participant M as LoginModel
participant H as HttpClient
participant S as LocalAuthServer
U->>V: 输入接口、账号、密码，点击登录
V->>V: 清空密码输入框
V-->>C: loginRequested(endpoint, account, password)
C->>C: 校验输入，阻止重复请求
C->>M: beginLogin()
M-->>C: changed()
C->>V: applyLoginState(LoggingIn)
C->>H: postJson(/auth/login, credentials)
H-->>C: requestId
H->>S: POST HTTP JSON
S->>S: 校验 root / root（本地开发）
S-->>H: 200 会话 或 401 错误
alt 2xx 且会话字段有效
H-->>C: succeeded(id, status, JSON)
C->>M: completeLogin(token, userId, name, expiresIn)
else HTTP / 网络失败或响应无效
H-->>C: failed(id, message, status) 或 succeeded(无效会话)
C->>M: failLogin(message)
end
M-->>C: changed()
C->>V: applyLoginState(message, busy=false, loggedIn)
V->>V: 成功显示媒体工作台；失败保留登录页
